# argument                           |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .......................................................................................................
tag                                  |   string       |  optional   |   toymc
run                                  |   integer      |  optional   |   0
ntoymc                               |   integer      |  optional   |   1
fit-param-list                       |   string       |  optional   |   standard
param-values-option                  |   string       |  optional   |   randomize-all;prefit-errors
fitter                               |   string       |  optional   |   minuit
config                               |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
mesg-thresholds                      |   string       |  optional   |   verbosity.xml
with-stat-fluct,without-stat-fluct   |   boolean_list |  optional   |   with-stat-fluct
store-spectra,discard-spectra        |   boolean_list |  optional   |   discard-spectra
start-at-true,start-at-central       |   boolean_list |  optional   |   start-at-true
rethrow-unphysical,accept-unphysical |   boolean_list |  optional   |   rethrow-unphysical
true-from-filename                   |   string       |  optional   |   NONE 
true-from-objname                    |   string       |  optional   |   central_values 
pot-override                         |   double       |  optional   |   -999
input-mixing12                       |   double       |  optional   |   0.304
input-mixing13                       |   double       |  optional   |   0.0219
input-mixing23                       |   double       |  optional   |	0.514
input-dm12sq                         |   double       |  optional   |   0.000075
input-dm23sq                         |   double       |  optional   |   0.00244
input-deltaCP                        |   double       |  optional   |   0.0
fix-mixing12                         |   boolean      |  optional   |   false
fix-mixing13                         |   boolean      |  optional   |   false
fix-mixing23                         |   boolean      |  optional   |   false
fix-dm12sq                           |   boolean      |  optional   |   false
fix-dm23sq                           |   boolean      |  optional   |   false
fix-deltaCP                          |   boolean      |  optional   |   false
fix-at-deltaCP                       |   double       |  optional   |   -999
flat-prior-mixing12                  |   boolean      |  optional   |   false				     
flat-prior-mixing13                  |   boolean      |  optional   |   false				     
flat-prior-mixing23                  |   boolean      |  optional   |   false				     
flat-prior-dm12sq                    |   boolean      |  optional   |   false				     
flat-prior-dm23sq                    |   boolean      |  optional   |   false				     
flat-prior-deltaCP                   |   boolean      |  optional   |   false				     
normal,inverted                      |   boolean_list |  optional   |   normal
first-octant,second-octant           |   boolean_list |  optional   |   first-octant
sinsqtheta, sinsq2theta              |   boolean_list |  optional   |   sinsqtheta
dmsq12abs23,foglilisi                |   boolean_list |  optional   |   dmsq12abs23           
